{"kind": "mod", "id": 1676, "name": "Interactable Exfils API", "slug": "interactable-exfils-api", "teaser": "Adds interaction prompts to exfils, letting you toggle the exfil timer on and off (you can finally loot that body without extracting!) as well as API tools for modders to add their own exfil interaction options.", "owner_name": "Jehree", "downloads": 23849, "favourites": 34, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Creative Commons BY-NC-ND 4.0", "guid": "jehree.interactableexfilsapi", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:50:34.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-08-23T05:04:08.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-08-23T05:04:08.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.11", "latest_version": "2.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/legalcode", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Modders, see “Modders” tab for info on the API functions of this mod</strong></p>\n<p>On its own, this mod does very little.</p>\n<p>It will:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Make all extracts have an “Extract” prompt appear when you are inside their extraction zone. Interacting with it will toggle the extraction timer (read: loot bodies that end up in an extraction area without accidentally extracting)</li>\n<li>BepInEx config option exists to set whether the timer will be on immediately upon entering an exfil zone or if it will require you to interact with it first.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PLEASE DO NOT REDISTRIBUTE THIS MOD</p>\n<p><strong>If you are using it as a dependency to one of your projects, <em>link it as a dependency.</em> Do not package it with your upload.</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Jehree/GifDump/blob/main/InteractableExfil.gif?raw=true\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/Jehree/GifDump/blob/main/InteractableExfil.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"InteractableExfil.gif?raw=true\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>If you’d like to support my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/jehree\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee!</a></strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Modders</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Jehree/SPT-InteractableExfilsAPI/blob/main/README.md\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Documentation link</a></p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1928, "published_at": "2024-08-29T03:15:56.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1676/interactable-exfils-api/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 366, "published_at": "2024-12-15T02:41:30.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1676/interactable-exfils-api/1.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.3.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 867, "published_at": "2024-12-16T02:16:56.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1676/interactable-exfils-api/1.3.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.4.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 605, "published_at": "2025-01-01T16:24:12.000000Z", "forge_link": "ht